build.prompt:
Project directory: {{inputs.dir}}
Read the approved plan at the plan files in ai-artifacts/workflows/{{inputs.slug}}/ and implement it.

This is attempt {{visit}}. On a retry the previous attempt's changes are already in the working tree. If QA previously failed, fix the causes in this report:
{{results.qa.report}}

Run {{inputs.checks}} before you finish. List the files you changed.

branches.prompt:
Project directory: {{inputs.dir}}
Plan: the plan files in ai-artifacts/workflows/{{inputs.slug}}/
Coder summary:
{{results.build.summary}}

Review the change for CORRECTNESS: bugs, unhandled failures, invalid states, missing tests. Use git diff.

Project directory: {{inputs.dir}}
Plan: the plan files in ai-artifacts/workflows/{{inputs.slug}}/
Coder summary:
{{results.build.summary}}

Review the change for DESIGN and FIT: does it match the plan and the codebase conventions, are names clear, is it the simplest change? Use git diff.

agree.prompt:
Project directory: {{inputs.dir}}
Approved plan: the plan files in ai-artifacts/workflows/{{inputs.slug}}/

Two reviewers looked at the same change.

Reviewer A:
{{results.review.a.text}}

Reviewer B:
{{results.review.b.text}}

Merge their findings. Keep what is real and in scope of the plan; drop the rest with a reason. Resolve conflicts against the plan.

fix.prompt:
Project directory: {{inputs.dir}}
Approved plan: the plan files in ai-artifacts/workflows/{{inputs.slug}}/
The change is already in the working tree. Apply ONLY these agreed fixes:
{{results.agree.fixes}}

Run {{inputs.checks}} before you finish.

qa.prompt:
Project directory: {{inputs.dir}}
Approved plan: the plan files in ai-artifacts/workflows/{{inputs.slug}}/
Run {{inputs.checks}}, then test the changed behaviour by hand. Decide pass or fail against the plan. On attempt {{visit}}, choose give_up if it still fails after three attempts.

Run history:
{{run.history}}

report.prompt:
QA passed. First update the project docs in {{inputs.dir}} that this change affects. Then write ai-artifacts/workflows/{{inputs.slug}}/run-report.html: a report of this build run for Iury. Show the outcome at the top (PASSED), then the plan, attempts, review findings and which were fixed, QA evidence, and anything left open.

Plan file: the plan files in ai-artifacts/workflows/{{inputs.slug}}/

Run log:
{{run.history}}

Latest coder summary:
{{results.build.summary}}
Reviewer A:
{{results.review.a.text}}
Reviewer B:
{{results.review.b.text}}
Agreed fixes:
{{results.agree.fixes}}
Dropped:
{{results.agree.dropped}}
Fresh coder:
{{results.fix.summary}}
QA:
{{results.qa.report}}
